      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA90194F4D5E748F154EBAFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B357285BF653EF59225C0D62306642000A67096C9267095584752862DB5F0F7684967796315440FF1F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陷阱指的就是在使用某些招式後，\n會留在地上的效果。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96779631630776845C31662F57284F7F752867D04E9B62DB5F0F5F8CFF0C000A67037559572857304E0A76846548679C300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "留在地上的火焰、岩石\n有時會阻礙寶可夢移動，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n觸碰到時也可能會造成傷害。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7559572857304E0A7684706B713030015CA977F3000A670966426703963B79195BF653EF592279FB52D5FF0C00100001BE00000A89F878B0523066424E5F53EF80FD67039020621050B75BB3300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可以教<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳認識\n陷阱是多麼恐怖的東西喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF4EE5655900100003110000FF01014F6059B38A8D8B58000A96779631662F591A9EBC6050601676846771897F5594300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳下定決心要透過實戰來學習，\n就告訴我一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0B5B9A6C7A5FC38981900F904E5BE662304F865B787FD2FF0C000A5C31544A8A3462114E0080725427300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要和我這個設陷阱的行家\n對戰看看嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
